# Testing and validation

- Validate the **specific task** you changed; do not rely on unrelated passing checks.
- Run `pnpm run lint` before finishing substantive code changes.
- Run `pnpm run typecheck` when types or shared modules change.
- Run `pnpm run build` when changes affect routes, types, or shared modules.
- Run `pnpm run test` in CI; there is no unit/e2e runner yet — do not claim tests passed unless you added and ran a real suite.
- For UI work: run `pnpm run dev`, exercise the affected pages, and inspect the browser console.
- For API work: hit endpoints with an authenticated session when possible; verify 401/404/402 behavior as relevant.
- Report validation honestly when handing off (PR or chat): command + result; never state "all tests pass" without evidence.
- Before finishing, run the self-review checklist in `.cursor/rules/engineering-quality.mdc` on the full diff.
- Git/PR steps: see `.cursor/rules/git-workflow.mdc`. Cloud Agent PR handoff: [docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md).
